        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Top-to-bottom data flow inside CalculatorEngine.evaluate(...). Each stage names the exact method, the data it produces and the error codes it can raise. The optional LRU token cache sits on the left; the error path on the right. Verified against CalculatorEngine, Tokenizer, PostfixParser, Evaluator, CalculatorEngineUtils." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="1316" x="44" y="96" as="geometry" />
