        <mxCell id="cacheb" parent="cache" style="text;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#F59E0B;fontColor=#78350F;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" value="If enabled: lookupCache(key) before tokenizing; storeCache(key, tokens) after.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key = normalized expression. Tokens cached &lt;b&gt;before&lt;/b&gt; variable substitution. Postfix and results are not cached. See diagram 09." vertex="1">
